+Normative scope: AX v0.7.0 Section 4.2 (tmux backend: dedicated -S
+server, no ambient/default discovery or reuse, credential-sensitive
+creation, background broker-or-refuse with typed capability_unavailable
+and no fallback to direct creation, launchctl managername as diagnostic
+hint only, cached observations never authorize resume), Section 4.C
