+
+`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py`:
+29 narrowing rows KILLED, 1 supplementary additive row KILLED
+(D-background-fallback, labeled), 1 harmless control SURVIVED, on two
+full passes with identical verdicts and one raw log per plant per run.
+Rows N-deps-background and N-deps-foreground kill by panic: the
+admitted request calls the nil dependency and the panic fails the
